# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1
# VEDO EduTrack SPA — Go embed variant.
#
# NOTE: RETIRED as a standalone image (M0.3). The SPA embed mechanism now
# lives inside the backend binary: backend/Dockerfile builds the SPA in a
# node stage and embeds frontend/dist at
# backend/internal/platform/spa/frontend/dist, producing ONE binary that
# serves both API and SPA from one port.
#
# This file is kept as a documentation reference for the M0.2 embed approach
# (standalone spa-embed server). It is NOT built by Makefile targets anymore;
# the `docker-build-frontend-embed` target now builds the unified backend
# image (see Makefile and deploy/README.md).
#
# The M0.2 stages (for reference):
#   Stage 1: node:24-alpine — build the SPA (Vite/pnpm)
#   Stage 2: golang:1.26-alpine — build the spa-embed Go server with dist/
#   Stage 3: distroless static — runtime
#
# See ADR-DES.INFRA.modular-monolith-approach and deploy/README.md.
